    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "harness_col1_txt",
      "x": 70, "y": 550, "width": 480, "height": 160,
      "text": "1. Golden Capture  (One-time)\n- record.sh intercepts runner using mitmproxy\n- Captures official GHA backend responses\n- Saves flows.jsonl (sequence of request/response objects)\n- Scenarios 06 to 15 represent workflow surface areas\n  (multistep, step failure, needs DAG, matrix expansion,\n   OIDC id-token, artifacts, composite actions, etc.)",
      "originalText": "1. Golden Capture  (One-time)\n- record.sh intercepts runner using mitmproxy\n- Captures official GHA backend responses\n- Saves flows.jsonl (sequence of request/response objects)\n- Scenarios 06 to 15 represent workflow surface areas\n  (multistep, step failure, needs DAG, matrix expansion,\n   OIDC id-token, artifacts, composite actions, etc.)",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#065f46", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400055, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400056,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "harness_col1", "lineHeight": 1.45
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "harness_col2",
      "x": 590, "y": 540, "width": 500, "height": 180,
      "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400057, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400058,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "harness_col2_txt", "type": "text"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "harness_col2_txt",
      "x": 600, "y": 550, "width": 480, "height": 160,
      "text": "2. Replay & Compare  (Pure Rust)\n- runner-watch loads flows.jsonl for target scenario\n- materialise_replay_state pre-queues mock GHA jobs\n- Replays request flow sequentially to aksh via reqwest\n- rewrite_replay_body maps golden message IDs to aksh IDs\n- compare.rs compares status codes against golden baseline\n- Skips capture artifact flows with null status (None-status)\n- Ignores un-replayable PKI/OAuth & timing message polls",
      "originalText": "2. Replay & Compare  (Pure Rust)\n- runner-watch loads flows.jsonl for target scenario\n- materialise_replay_state pre-queues mock GHA jobs\n- Replays request flow sequentially to aksh via reqwest\n- rewrite_replay_body maps golden message IDs to aksh IDs\n- compare.rs compares status codes against golden baseline\n- Skips capture artifact flows with null status (None-status)\n- Ignores un-replayable PKI/OAuth & timing message polls",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#065f46", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400059, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400060,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "harness_col2", "lineHeight": 1.45
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "harness_col3",
      "x": 1120, "y": 540, "width": 500, "height": 180,
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400062,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "harness_col3_txt", "type": "text"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "harness_col3_txt",
      "x": 1130, "y": 550, "width": 480, "height": 160,
      "text": "3. Replay Caveats  (Honest gaps)\n- CacheService stubs return cache-miss and fake urls\n- ArtifactService stubs return fake URLs, empty list\n- Action resolution / tarball download calls to codeload\n  and launch are in should_skip_replay_path and skipped\n- Gate passes when HTTP status codes match baseline\n- Body content and actual cache/artifact bytes are not verified",
